name: Review groups and goals have distinct controls and preserve the composer
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/review_readers.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 FINDINGS | review-origin
nav-mode:
require-live-snap: 20 O goals | review-navigation
expect: G groups
keys: G
require-live-snap: 25 GROUPED FINDINGS | groups
expect: 3 findings
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 GROUP MEMBERS | members
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | selected-member
keys: O
require-live-snap: 25 Unassessed | goals
expect: GOAL RELEVANCE
expect: workspace
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Viewing Review | restored-review
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/reader-draft.txt
live-snap: composer-draft
keys: Escape
nav-mode:
keys: C-_
live-snap: restored-draft-navigation
keys: G
require-live-snap: 25 GROUP MEMBERS | members-with-draft
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 GROUPED FINDINGS | groups-with-draft
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Viewing Review | review-with-draft
keys: O
require-live-snap: 25 Unassessed | goals-with-draft
resize: 160x48
live-snap: readers-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: readers-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: readers-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: readers-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Esc return | readers-40x12
ask: Do groups and goals open distinct views, preserve selection and the unsent draft, and retain readable controls at all six sizes without implying a finding verdict?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Viewing Review | returned-review
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 paste #1 | prompt-restored
keys: C-y
require-live-snap: 20 Unsent review draft | paste-inspected
expect: 東京 cursor evidence
keys: Escape
keys: Escape
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 25 FINDINGS | restarted-review
nav-mode:
keys: G
require-live-snap: 25 GROUPED FINDINGS | restarted-groups
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Viewing Review | restarted-origin
keys: O
require-live-snap: 25 Unassessed | restarted-goals
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/review_readers.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does no-color restart keep both readers reachable with three unchanged observations, no finding or goal decisions, and no approved or billable work?
keys: Escape
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
